/span> <span begin="0:39.182" end="0:39.796">ei</span> <span begin="0:39.796" end="0:42.251">frământ,</span></p><p begin="0:42.251" end="0:47.161" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.251" end="0:42.865">Căci</span> <span begin="0:42.865" end="0:44.092">râvna</span> <span begin="0:44.092" end="0:45.320">pentru</span> <span begin="0:45.320" end="0:46.547">Casa</span> <span begin="0:46.547" end="0:47.161">Ta</span></p><p begin="0:47.161" end="0:51.372" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.161" end="0:47.775">E</span> <span begin="0:47.775" end="0:48.389">tot</span> <span begin="0:48.389" end="0:49.003">ce</span> <span begin="0:49.003" end="0:49.616">am</span> <span begin="0:49.616" end="0:50.230">mai</span> <span begin="0:50.230" end="0:51.372">sfânt!</span></p><p begin="0:51.372" end="0:56.282" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.372" end="0:51.985">Sunt</span> <span begin="0:51.985" end="0:52.599">zi</span> <span begin="0:52.599" end="0:53.213">de</span> <span begin="0:53.213" end="0:53.827">zi</span> <span begin="0:53.827" end="0:56.282">batjocorit,</span></p><p begin="0:56.282" end="1:01.192" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.282" end="0:56.896">Dar</span> <span begin="0:56.896" end="0:57.510">nu</span> <span begin="0:57.510" end="0:58.123">uit</span> <span begin="0:58.123" end="0:59.351">Legea</span> <span begin="0:59.351" end="1:01.192">Ta.</span></p><p begin="1:01.192" end="1:06.103" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.192" end="1:01.806">Eu</span> <span begin="1:01.806" end="1:02.420">știu</span> <span begin="1:02.420" end="1:03.034">că</span> <span begin="1:03.034" end="1:03.648">nu</span> <span begin="1:03.648" end="1:04.261">m-ai</span> <span begin="1:04.261" end="1:06.103">părăsit,</span></p><p begin="1:06.103" end="1:13.933" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.103" end="1:07.330">Rămâi</span> <span begin="1:07.330" end="1:07.944">la</span> <span begin="1:07.944" end="1:09.172">dreapta</span> <span begin="1:09.172" end="1:13.933">mea!</span></p><p begin="1:13.933" end="1:18.844" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.933" end="1:14.547">Te</span> <span begin="1:14.547" end="1:15.775">scoală,</span> <span begin="1:15.775" end="1:17.002">Doamne,</span> <span begin="1:17.002" end="1:17.616">să</span> <span begin="1:17.616" end="1:18.844">răzbuni</span></p><p begin="1:18.844" end="1:23.754" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.844" end="1:19.457">Pe</span> <span begin="1:19.457" end="1:20.685">sfinții</span> <span begin="1:20.685" end="1:21.299">Tăi</span> <span begin="1:21.299" end="1:23.754">martiri,</span></p><p begin="1:23.754" end="1:28.664" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.754" end="1:24.368">Să</span> <span begin="1:24.368" end="1:24.982">faci</span> <span begin="1:24.982" end="1:26.823">dreptate</span> <span begin="1:26.823" end="1:28.051">celor</span> <span begin="1:28.051" end="1:28.664">buni,</span></p><p begin="1:28.664" end="1:31.733" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.664" end="1:29.278">Să</span> <span begin="1:29.278" end="1:29.892">vii</span> <span begin="1:29.892" end="1:30.506">cu</span> <span begin="1:30.506" end="1:31.733">răsplătiri!</span></p></div></body></tt>